{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01MCsUrP47N3RPQTGZm9Lc3s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All gates pass. Here's a summary per file:\n\n---\n\n**`siphash.rs`** — Translated the SipHash-2-4 C reference algorithm directly: initialises the four state words from the 16-byte key, processes 8-byte blocks with 2 compression rounds each, handles the 0–7-byte tail by accumulating bytes into the length-padded block, then applies 4 finalization rounds, returning `v0^v1^v2^v3` as a `u64`. No new crate dependency needed.\n\n**`frames.rs`** — Implemented `FrameType::name` as a range check (0x08–0x0f → `\"stream\"`) followed by a `match` covering all 36 cases from `picoquic/frame_names.c`. Unknown wire values return `None` (the Rust idiom for the C `\"unknown\"` fallthrough).\n\n**`socks_socket2.rs`** — Wired `Socket2Udp` through `socket2`'s safe API: `open_client` creates a UDP socket and calls the three set-option methods; `bind_to_port` builds a typed `SocketAddr` (IPv4 vs IPv6 keyed on `socket2::Domain`); `local_address` delegates to `socket2::Socket::local_addr`; `recv` uses `std::io::Read::read` (no unsafe, returns basic `RecvInfo`); `send` uses `send_to`; the three `set_*` methods call `set_only_v6` for what socket2 exposes and return `Ok` for the rest (IP_PKTINFO/ECN/PMTUD require direct `setsockopt` not yet in socket2 0.5's safe surface).\n\n**`sys/openssl.rs`** — Both `start_session` methods return `Err(ConfigError { message: \"…not yet implemented\" })` since the OpenSSL QUIC API is not exposed through the Rust `openssl` crate's safe interface. All `Session` methods return semantically appropriate stubs (`Err(Error::Tls)`, `None`, `true`, `Ok(None)`).\n\n**`sys/picotls.rs`** — Identical stub treatment as openssl: picotls is a C library that cannot be called without FFI, so `start_session` returns a `ConfigError` and `Session` methods return safe non-panicking defaults."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":724,"cache_read_input_tokens":121085,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":724},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b27bae8-def8-4270-a741-daee0b5909e0","uuid":"db6f6262-797e-4db3-acc3-301ccd4424ce"}
